[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l007","ordinal":294145,"en":"She was no mere Chürök, but a dark hour,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l008","ordinal":294146,"en":"A black calamity and disaster."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l009","ordinal":294147,"en":"She was the very source of consuming fire,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l010","ordinal":294148,"en":"The dark eye of affliction."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l011","ordinal":294149,"en":"Aichürök was calamity itself,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l012","ordinal":294150,"en":"The dark eye of turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l013","ordinal":294151,"en":"Though taken as spoil and wed by force,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l014","ordinal":294152,"en":"Chürök would not lose heart."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l015","ordinal":294153,"en":"While Chürök’s eyes remained open,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l016","ordinal":294154,"en":"The Jediger’s undertaking would not prosper."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l017","ordinal":294155,"en":"That noble, formidable woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l018","ordinal":294156,"en":"Renowned Chürök, would not vanish."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l019","ordinal":294157,"en":"If you wronged Aichürök too greatly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l020","ordinal":294158,"en":"She would strip the flesh from a horse’s neck;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l021","ordinal":294159,"en":"Flying through the air,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l022","ordinal":294160,"en":"She would travel the whole world."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l023","ordinal":294161,"en":"If she flew away, she would become a swan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l024","ordinal":294162,"en":"And uproar would break out among the Jediger."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l025","ordinal":294163,"en":"If Aichürök gathered her wits,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l026","ordinal":294164,"en":"Destruction would come from her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l027","ordinal":294165,"en":"Wait and see, if she survives,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l028","ordinal":294166,"en":"Strife will arise from warrior Kyyaz."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l029","ordinal":294167,"en":"Chürök is a woman taken as spoil,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l030","ordinal":294168,"en":"Yet she is no mere woman but calamity."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l031","ordinal":294169,"en":"While Chürök and Kyyaz live,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l032","ordinal":294170,"en":"If Aichürök becomes enraged,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l033","ordinal":294171,"en":"She will be the Jediger’s demon."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l034","ordinal":294172,"en":"If she suddenly grows excited,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l035","ordinal":294173,"en":"If she suddenly takes flight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l036","ordinal":294174,"en":"She will be the Jediger’s demon.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l037","ordinal":294175,"en":"The people who had come spoke in an uproar"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l038","ordinal":294176,"en":"And returned to their own lands."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l039","ordinal":294177,"en":"The great host of khans departed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l001","ordinal":294178,"en":"Many souls grieved."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l002","ordinal":294179,"en":"One urged another onward from behind:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l003","ordinal":294180,"en":"“Go, for conflict will arise"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l004","ordinal":294181,"en":"From Aichürök’s suffering.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l005","ordinal":294182,"en":"The great people clamored, saying this,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l006","ordinal":294183,"en":"Speaking of such ominous wonders."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l007","ordinal":294184,"en":"Let us leave that matter there;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l008","ordinal":294185,"en":"Of the great people in Jeti-Özön,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l009","ordinal":294186,"en":"Let us begin the news of the nation."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l010","ordinal":294187,"en":"Of warrior Kyyaz among the people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l011","ordinal":294188,"en":"Let us begin the tale of the lion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l012","ordinal":294189,"en":"When word came of Kyyaz’s command,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l013","ordinal":294190,"en":"The restless Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l014","ordinal":294191,"en":"Gathered as a nation and filled the land;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l015","ordinal":294192,"en":"By Almighty Allah’s will,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l016","ordinal":294193,"en":"So many souls assembled."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l017","ordinal":294194,"en":"Their old men came crawling,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l018","ordinal":294195,"en":"Their children came tumbling,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l019","ordinal":294196,"en":"And all arrived in throngs."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l020","ordinal":294197,"en":"The Jediger people beheld"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l021","ordinal":294198,"en":"A vast feast that split the sky."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l022","ordinal":294199,"en":"At the royal palace,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l023","ordinal":294200,"en":"In the courtyard built for a khan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l024","ordinal":294201,"en":"One that surpassed all others in the land,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l025","ordinal":294202,"en":"At Aichürök’s pavilion,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l026","ordinal":294203,"en":"For the proud, fierce woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l027","ordinal":294204,"en":"Rubies and precious stones"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l028","ordinal":294205,"en":"Had been set in alternating rows."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l029","ordinal":294206,"en":"A jewel as large as a horse’s head"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l030","ordinal":294207,"en":"Had been set with ceremony"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l031","ordinal":294208,"en":"In the eye of the yurt’s crown-ring."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l032","ordinal":294209,"en":"Golden nails were driven in;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l033","ordinal":294210,"en":"Letters and figures were traced in gold"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l034","ordinal":294211,"en":"Around the lattice walls."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l035","ordinal":294212,"en":"In making this royal yurt,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l036","ordinal":294213,"en":"Much of the blood-shedding khan’s treasure"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l037","ordinal":294214,"en":"Had plainly been spent."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l038","ordinal":294215,"en":"Poor Aichürök’s royal yurt,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l039","ordinal":294216,"en":"While the gray-maned hero was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l001","ordinal":294217,"en":"Was folded away for the winter;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l002","ordinal":294218,"en":"When the days of summer came,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l003","ordinal":294219,"en":"It was pitched for excursions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l004","ordinal":294220,"en":"Upon the blue-mottled field."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l005","ordinal":294221,"en":"Its threshold, fashioned from ruby,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l006","ordinal":294222,"en":"Was beautifully formed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l007","ordinal":294223,"en":"Merely to behold it"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l008","ordinal":294224,"en":"Satisfied the human heart."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l009","ordinal":294225,"en":"The canopy of that ill-omened pavilion"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l010","ordinal":294226,"en":"Had a brocaded crown,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l011","ordinal":294227,"en":"And that wondrous pavilion"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l012","ordinal":294228,"en":"Was embroidered all around."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l013","ordinal":294229,"en":"Silver wire was wound"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l014","ordinal":294230,"en":"Through the eyes of its lattice walls;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l015","ordinal":294231,"en":"The ends of the roof poles"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l016","ordinal":294232,"en":"Were ceremonially bound"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l017","ordinal":294233,"en":"With gold."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l018","ordinal":294234,"en":"Every eye of the lattice wall"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l019","ordinal":294235,"en":"Had marvelous nails like polished vessels."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l020","ordinal":294236,"en":"All the people and khans assembled"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l021","ordinal":294237,"en":"Seemed to stand gazing at the splendor."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l022","ordinal":294238,"en":"Among the Jediger of Jeti-Özön,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l023","ordinal":294239,"en":"All the bearded elders,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l024","ordinal":294240,"en":"Those who picked up distant news,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l025","ordinal":294241,"en":"The aged slaves who had lived long,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l026","ordinal":294242,"en":"The jesters who made many laugh,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l027","ordinal":294243,"en":"The yellow-haired bearers of hearsay—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l028","ordinal":294244,"en":"All the Jediger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l029","ordinal":294245,"en":"Men who cultivated wisdom,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l030","ordinal":294246,"en":"Champions quick to devise a way,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l031","ordinal":294247,"en":"Within that royal yurt"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l032","ordinal":294248,"en":"Gazed in astonishment as a great crowd;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l033","ordinal":294249,"en":"Young and old craned forward to look."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l034","ordinal":294250,"en":"Some listened to tales"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l035","ordinal":294251,"en":"Of bygone times and precious deeds."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l036","ordinal":294252,"en":"Some judged formidable Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l037","ordinal":294253,"en":"Saying she was an extraordinary woman."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l038","ordinal":294254,"en":"Some rejoiced at seeing Aichürök"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l039","ordinal":294255,"en":"And delighted in the sight."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l001","ordinal":294256,"en":"Some, astonished by Aichürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l002","ordinal":294257,"en":"Cut their own hands"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l003","ordinal":294258,"en":"Instead of slicing the meat;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l004","ordinal":294259,"en":"Black blood flowed from their hands,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l005","ordinal":294260,"en":"And some withered in pain."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l006","ordinal":294261,"en":"At the sight of Aichürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l007","ordinal":294262,"en":"Their souls leapt with joy;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l008","ordinal":294263,"en":"The wrestlers who cut their hands"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l009","ordinal":294264,"en":"Had blood pouring from their sleeves."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l010","ordinal":294265,"en":"Their eyes shone and blazed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l011","ordinal":294266,"en":"“She is a woman unlike any other,” they said,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l012","ordinal":294267,"en":"And bit their fingers in amazement."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l013","ordinal":294268,"en":"“She has reached the utmost beauty"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l014","ordinal":294269,"en":"And perfect grace,” they said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l015","ordinal":294270,"en":"“She is a woman who has brought"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l016","ordinal":294271,"en":"Great trouble among the people,” they said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l017","ordinal":294272,"en":"“With a face radiant as the moon,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l018","ordinal":294273,"en":"She is Lady Chürök,” they said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l019","ordinal":294274,"en":"“She is a woman of calamity"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l020","ordinal":294275,"en":"Who has stirred strife throughout the world.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l021","ordinal":294276,"en":"The assembled Jediger craned to see;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l022","ordinal":294277,"en":"Astounded by the graceful bearing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l023","ordinal":294278,"en":"Of the unfortunate woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l024","ordinal":294279,"en":"The great host of black-clad Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l025","ordinal":294280,"en":"Stood gazing and trembling."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l026","ordinal":294281,"en":"“So this is the woman,” they said,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l027","ordinal":294282,"en":"Marveling one by one."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l028","ordinal":294283,"en":"Brave young men of courage"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l029","ordinal":294284,"en":"Stared until their eyes ached;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l030","ordinal":294285,"en":"Some stumbled and fell,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l031","ordinal":294286,"en":"And some seemed struck down."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l032","ordinal":294287,"en":"They stood shoulder to shoulder, craning to look;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l033","ordinal":294288,"en":"Able youths and promising sons"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l034","ordinal":294289,"en":"Gazed admiringly at your sister-in-law."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l035","ordinal":294290,"en":"Good heavens, souls are fashioned in every way!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l036","ordinal":294291,"en":"Everyone who beheld"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l037","ordinal":294292,"en":"That poor, fierce woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l038","ordinal":294293,"en":"Was struck with wonder."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l039","ordinal":294294,"en":"Among black-bearded men,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l001","ordinal":294295,"en":"Some of the people who stood watching"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l002","ordinal":294296,"en":"Felt their beards grow thin."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l003","ordinal":294297,"en":"“If only that radiant, unfortunate woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l004","ordinal":294298,"en":"Were my wife,” they thought;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l005","ordinal":294299,"en":"The boldest young men"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l006","ordinal":294300,"en":"Let their saliva run."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l007","ordinal":294301,"en":"They marveled at the sight of Chürök:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l008","ordinal":294302,"en":"“Among all human beings ever created,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l009","ordinal":294303,"en":"She is the radiant Night of Power;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l010","ordinal":294304,"en":"That shining, ill-fated woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l011","ordinal":294305,"en":"Is a noble princess reduced to bondage."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l012","ordinal":294306,"en":"Her waist is slender as a scabbard, her face like the moon—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l013","ordinal":294307,"en":"How renowned she is throughout the world!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l014","ordinal":294308,"en":"Apple-necked, with an argali’s breast,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l015","ordinal":294309,"en":"Her wide-set eyes surpass those of any mortal."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l016","ordinal":294310,"en":"With broad hips and long tasseled braids,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l017","ordinal":294311,"en":"She has beautifully wide-set eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l018","ordinal":294312,"en":"In a crimson coat, with a crescent waist,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l019","ordinal":294313,"en":"That graceful beauty"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l020","ordinal":294314,"en":"Is the wondrous one left among the people."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l021","ordinal":294315,"en":"That the great host was slaughtered"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l022","ordinal":294316,"en":"Is no lie but the truth;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l023","ordinal":294317,"en":"She herself is the renowned beauty."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l024","ordinal":294318,"en":"No ordinary mortal could produce such a soul;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l025","ordinal":294319,"en":"Her eyes are those of a noble princess."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l026","ordinal":294320,"en":"When one looks, her face shines;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l027","ordinal":294321,"en":"Her complexion changes and glows."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l028","ordinal":294322,"en":"When she eats and drinks, the food"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l029","ordinal":294323,"en":"Can be seen passing down her throat."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l030","ordinal":294324,"en":"Her supple body stirs like soft leather,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l031","ordinal":294325,"en":"And her face flashes like the sun;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l032","ordinal":294326,"en":"She speaks softly, glowing warmly."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l033","ordinal":294327,"en":"Golden buttons and forty fasteners"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l034","ordinal":294328,"en":"Dangle and chime"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l035","ordinal":294329,"en":"At the cuffs of her sleeves."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l036","ordinal":294330,"en":"Judging the unfortunate woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l037","ordinal":294331,"en":"Her whole figure is beauty itself."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l038","ordinal":294332,"en":"The black hair braided down her back"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l039","ordinal":294333,"en":"Is thick as a wrist.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l001","ordinal":294334,"en":"Of radiant Chürök they said:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l002","ordinal":294335,"en":"“She is no mere Chürök; this woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l003","ordinal":294336,"en":"Is a calamity who has thrown the people into turmoil.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l004","ordinal":294337,"en":"She smiled brightly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l005","ordinal":294338,"en":"Her white teeth gleaming like shovels."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l006","ordinal":294339,"en":"With a thimble mouth and camel-calf eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l007","ordinal":294340,"en":"In a crimson dress, with a crescent waist—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l008","ordinal":294341,"en":"Alas, the graceful, ill-fated woman!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l009","ordinal":294342,"en":"When one looked, she stood apart in dignity;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l010","ordinal":294343,"en":"Every movement of Chürök"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l011","ordinal":294344,"en":"Seemed bathed in moonlight."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l012","ordinal":294345,"en":"Her glowing white brow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l013","ordinal":294346,"en":"Satisfied every watching eye."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l014","ordinal":294347,"en":"She was slow to turn away;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l015","ordinal":294348,"en":"Longing to see Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l016","ordinal":294349,"en":"Not only Kyyaz but all the Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l017","ordinal":294350,"en":"Stared with doubled eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l018","ordinal":294351,"en":"Of the extraordinary Lady Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l019","ordinal":294352,"en":"The calamity on everyone’s lips,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l020","ordinal":294353,"en":"They said: “She has a thimble mouth and camel-calf eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l021","ordinal":294354,"en":"And speech as sweet as honey and sugar."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l022","ordinal":294355,"en":"Above her lip"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l023","ordinal":294356,"en":"There is the faintest trace"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l024","ordinal":294357,"en":"Of a tiny beauty mark."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l025","ordinal":294358,"en":"May your sister-in-law’s suffering end—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l026","ordinal":294359,"en":"Where is any flaw in her?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l027","ordinal":294360,"en":"She has the finest long hair;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l028","ordinal":294361,"en":"The noble, ill-fated woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l029","ordinal":294362,"en":"Is the mightiest among women."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l030","ordinal":294363,"en":"Look upon Chürök’s beauty—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l031","ordinal":294364,"en":"The purest wearer of a flowing dress;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l032","ordinal":294365,"en":"Is this not the very beauty,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l033","ordinal":294366,"en":"The queen of all women?”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l034","ordinal":294367,"en":"That day warrior Kyyaz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l035","ordinal":294368,"en":"Stirred the people and held his feast,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l036","ordinal":294369,"en":"Carrying out a plan no man could conceive."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l037","ordinal":294370,"en":"“Kyyaz has taken Chürök,” they said;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l038","ordinal":294371,"en":"Of all men anyone had seen,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l039","ordinal":294372,"en":"“Warrior Kyyaz has become the gray-maned champion,” they said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l001","ordinal":294373,"en":"The people bustled, holding a feast,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l002","ordinal":294374,"en":"And while the multitude stood thus,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l003","ordinal":294375,"en":"Hero Kiyaz, son of Bagysh,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l004","ordinal":294376,"en":"Who ruled the people and sustained the realm—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l005","ordinal":294377,"en":"Was this not Khan Kiyaz?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l006","ordinal":294378,"en":"He was a lord of highest rank;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l007","ordinal":294379,"en":"Among the Zhediger of Jeti-Ozon,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l008","ordinal":294380,"en":"The accomplished Kiyaz became khan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l009","ordinal":294381,"en":"Such was Kiyaz's standing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l010","ordinal":294382,"en":"Wrapped in the blue haze of celebration,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l011","ordinal":294383,"en":"Such was Kiyaz when you saw him."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l012","ordinal":294384,"en":"He strained like a gray tiger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l013","ordinal":294385,"en":"His weapons set in order;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l014","ordinal":294386,"en":"Such was hero Kiyaz's bearing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l015","ordinal":294387,"en":"A bare sword hung at his side,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l016","ordinal":294388,"en":"Like a cloud returning with rain,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l017","ordinal":294389,"en":"Wrath spread across his face."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l018","ordinal":294390,"en":"Thick-wristed and stone-hearted—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l019","ordinal":294391,"en":"If you ask what Kiyaz was like,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l020","ordinal":294392,"en":"He was powerfully built and fierce."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l021","ordinal":294393,"en":"His lashes were flame, his eyes embers;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l022","ordinal":294394,"en":"Among men there was none like him."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l023","ordinal":294395,"en":"Looming over the front of his saddle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l024","ordinal":294396,"en":"Broad as a tinsmith's bellows,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l025","ordinal":294397,"en":"His bristling mustache"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l026","ordinal":294398,"en":"Was like the handle of a great whip."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l027","ordinal":294399,"en":"Above his eyes, his black brows"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1399:b003:l028","ordinal":294400,"en":"Were like fists turned downward."}]
